cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "distmarg: distance-marginalized gravitational-wave likelihood"
abstract: >-
  Distance-marginalized gravitational-wave likelihood ln(L_D / Z_N) in the
  (rho_mf, v*) basis, with and without phase marginalization, for any smooth
  tabulated luminosity-distance prior. Two independent implementations are
  provided: an array-API Python package (numpy, JAX, torch, CuPy) and a Rust
  crate with Python bindings.
authors:
  - family-names: Talbot
    given-names: Colm
    affiliation: Princeton University
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ColmTalbot/distance_marginalization"
keywords:
  - gravitational waves
  - Bayesian inference
  - likelihood
  - marginalization
  - Rust
  - Python
